  "projectUrl": "https://www.inetlab.com/Products/MM7.html",
  "published": "2026-06-04T23:10:03.23Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Changed\n- migrate ASP.NET Core sample to .NET 10\n\nFixed\n- normalize inbound MM7 `Content` `href` CID references before MIME `Content-ID` resolution\n- handle `multipart/related` MM7 messages where presentation and media body parts are carried at the top level\n- resolve the SOAP envelope root part from the outer `multipart/related` `start` parameter and support both `text/xml` and `application/xml`",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": ".NET library for sending and receiving MMS messages over MM7 protocol.",
  "title": "Client/Server library for MM7 Protocol.",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.0.1",
